<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-11-01T09:33:00.941Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 09:33:00 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Al-Shabaab intensified assaults on Somali army positions in Lower Shabelle, killing a former al-Shabaab finance chief and increasing army casualties, while Somali forces reported recapturing about 55% of territory previously held by al-Shabaab and ISIS. Uganda began pulling its troops after 20 years and the African Union announced the withdrawal of forces from four bases in Lower Shabelle, while Ethiopia is pulling more than 3,000 troops from Somalia. The UAE carried out its first drone strike against al-Shabaab in nearly a year, and piracy incidents continued with the rescue of seven Pakistani crew members from a hijacked vessel. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxQN1U5NzFWNklOSmFZdFBFcDJoX2JJYUJ3eHFJT0Zla2RzdEdabi1hZXJ0eEplekRpR3ZYMDBuWXJNejJHOWlyazJBTFlLVjQ1bUlXZTVSVTZPdUVLcktEUXJGbjN5UVVCLThLemNaSi1TT1ota2RpNXlwVTlYNnBIeC1sX2RnQmtkcXp1SW40dnlxM0l1?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE45aFRzRjI0QV9tVWdFbWRLemFaN1B1d01PaHNOanhjcHJWMTYta2ZpclhBZ3V0NzlDSW1rcFFmNlpGZ0JJN3ZwVFZPMlFlMm4tRjd0RFVfZWU5WHM?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxNSE84VGhwOGdhbkZGY1NNQXBYUURlSlRXMTF2ZWk2VmQ1MEhWTEJwTndFcFZwMUx2Uzk2cjNrN1VpMmFKU0pudkE2cEJ3cEllbkI1cHlJZG44SzdSekd2ay05NmROTzloY19LMXBBMVI1OXVLaXdzSW5lRk5IZVkzMXJ6aERNeXJTdlRJU2kwaHV0SUdfRElCRA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPNzdxT0hGaF8yc29NbWhvQWJvcXEyLXNPTVMtOE9sSTNDMEYyNXNfVXowTGJaaGdSbFNtNnR3ZjBTTGt5Ry1PQnNRbHlSWG9OZFprY0p3SXhUYzlTQ05HYjYxQmk0dnA3ZjcyOFVlb0Q1azItTVFja3ZEVFdYdFhQaTQyZDYyWW5nXzktMm43Y3dDQXBvekJxc0xMMkM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a